# Paper sync rule

**Do not** update [`paper/main.tex`](paper/main.tex) (or other files under `paper/`) when implementing code, config, UI, docs, or tests.

Only edit the LaTeX paper when the user **explicitly** asks to change it.

README and other project docs may still be updated when relevant to the task.
